<title>UK: DePfa adds 50 million guilders to Nov 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa adds 50 million guilders to Nov 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 300 million guilders from 250 million guilders, lead manager ING Barings said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Deutsche Pfandbrief- und Hypothekenbank AG</p>
<p> AMT   *50 MLN DFL    COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    30.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.365   PAY DATE    14.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    101.90    YIELD	 4.005 PCT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.175     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING 250 MLN DFL LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		23.APR.96</p>
<p>		LAUNCHED OFF A DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
